get.description:
Return distinct source repos with last synced revision and timestamp.

Aggregates ``source_repo``, ``MAX(source_revision)``, and ``MAX(synced_at)``
from the ``content`` table for the given project.

Response shape::

    {"sources": [
        {
            "source_repo": "...",
            "last_synced_revision": "...",
            "last_synced_at": "ISO-8601 timestamp"
        },
        ...
    ]}

Return metadata for all registered dashboard widgets.

Callers use this to discover which widgets exist, what scopes they support,
and what filters (if any) are required.

Response::

    {
        "widgets": [
            {
                "slug": "passfail_trend",
                "title": "Pass / fail trend",
                "scope_kinds": ["plan", "project"],
                "requires": []
            },
            …
        ]
    }
